## RELEASE-{version} — production release META

This ticket is the state machine for the **{version}** production
release. It carries no implementation work itself; the 13 child
tickets `R1`..`R13` (linked below) drive the release cycle end-to-end,
serialised by a `blockedBy` chain.

The JIRA graph IS the conductor. The runner JQL IS the executor.
There is no external orchestration service — pickup of each child
depends on its blocker reaching Published, exactly as for any other
runner ticket. (See `docs/operations/release-conductor-pattern.md`
and `docs/operations/release-conductor-runbook.md` for the long-form
contract.)

